  <section class="feat" id="resume">
    <div class="wrap feat-in">
      <div class="feat-copy" data-reveal>
        <h2>Pick up where you left off, in anything</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Files, links and individual torrent episodes all resume, behind a screen of unfinished
          videos with their own poster frames — decoded out of the file, or captured while a torrent
          was still arriving and the data was only briefly there.
        </p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
            <span><b>A finished video leaves the list by itself</b>, and a torrent keeps its own record of which episodes you have watched.</span></li>
          <li><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>
            <span><b>A season is one row, not nine cards.</b> Clicking it continues the episode you were on rather than asking again.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-mock" data-reveal style="--dl:1">
        <div class="win" data-scene data-dur="2800">
          <div class="win-bar"><span class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="name">Start screen</span><span class="wb-brand"><span>Frame Player</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-mark"/></svg></span></div>
          <div class="startscr">
            <p class="st-title">FRAME PLAYER</p>
            <p class="st-hint">Drop a video file here, or open one with the button</p>
            <div class="st-actions">
              <span class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Open file</span>
              <span class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Open a link</span>
              <span class="btn btn-catalog btn-sm">Catalog</span>
            </div>
            <p class="st-sec">Continue watching</p>
            <div class="rail">
              <div class="card now" style="--i:0">
                <span class="card-poster"><img src="/img/dawn-limb.jpg" alt="The line of dawn on the limb of the Earth" width="560" height="383" decoding="async" loading="lazy"><span class="card-progress" style="--v:62%"></span></span>
                <span class="card-name">Orbital Night<span class="sep"></span>S02E03</span>
                <span class="card-left">23:14 left</span>
              </div>
              <div class="card" style="--i:1">
                <span class="card-poster"><img src="/img/comet-trails.jpg" alt="Star trails and a comet over desert trees" width="560" height="373" decoding="async" loading="lazy"><span class="card-progress" style="--v:18%"></span></span>
                <span class="card-name">The Long Night</span>
                <span class="card-left">1:41:02 left</span>
              </div>
              <div class="card" style="--i:2">
                <span class="card-poster"><img src="/img/harbour-sunset.jpg" alt="Boats in a harbour at a red sunset" width="560" height="304" decoding="async" loading="lazy"><span class="card-progress" style="--v:88%"></span></span>
                <span class="card-name">Harbour Lights (2023)</span>
                <span class="card-left">6:28 left</span>
              </div>
              <div class="card" style="--i:3">
                <span class="card-poster"><img src="/img/eruption.jpg" alt="A volcanic fissure erupting at night" width="560" height="315" decoding="async" loading="lazy"><span class="card-progress" style="--v:41%"></span></span>
                <span class="card-name">youtube.com<span class="sep"></span>Fissure eruption, 4K</span>
                <span class="card-left">link</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="st-sec">Torrents</p>
            <div class="torrow">
              <span class="glyph"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></span>
              <span>
                <span class="t1">Orbital Night<span class="sep"></span>season 2</span>
                <span class="t2 mono">9 videos<span class="sep"></span>7.4 GB on disk<span class="sep"></span>continue: S02E03 — 23:14 left</span>
              </span>
              <span class="tag">RSS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
